ceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">ContactPoint</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Count" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Count</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Distance" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Distance</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Duration" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Duration</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#HumanName" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">HumanName</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Identifier" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Identifier</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Money" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Money</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Period" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Period</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Quantity" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Quantity</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Range" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Range</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Ratio" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Ratio</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/references.html" class="xhtPieceItalic">Reference</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic">(</span><span class="xhtPieceItalic">)</span><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceD