ieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Dosage" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Dosage</a><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Meta" class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">Meta</a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><span class="xhtPieceItalic xhtPieceDeEmphasized">If parameter is a data type</span><br class="xhtPieceItalic"/><span class="xhtPieceBold xhtPieceItalic">Slice: </span><span class="xhtPieceItalic">Unordered, Open by type:$this</span><br class="xhtPieceItalic"/><span class="xhtPieceBold xhtPieceItalic">Slicing Note: </span><span class="xhtPieceItalic">Other type slices that contain no new information are not shown in this view</span></td></tr>
